#!/usr/bin/python3
"""Authenticated Win32 SendInput to native Linux input backends for UU Remote.

The Windows hook writes compact, versioned UDP datagrams to a random loopback
port.  The endpoint file is readable only by the current user and contains a
fresh 128-bit token for each daemon lifetime. Valid mouse and keyboard events
are injected through XTest on X11 or the RemoteDesktop portal on Wayland.
"""

